spell.core.fortune.description.advanced:
{Advanced Fortune}

Increases {Luck} of {target allied unit} by {+2}.

{While Fortune lasts}, {Luck penalties} cannot reduce that unit below {+2 Luck}.

spell.core.fortune.description.basic:
{Basic Fortune}

Increases {Luck} of {target allied unit} by {+1}.

{While Fortune lasts}, {Luck penalties} cannot reduce that unit below {+1 Luck}.

spell.core.fortune.description.expert:
{Expert Fortune}

Increases {Luck} of {all allied units} by {+2}.

{While Fortune lasts}, {Luck penalties} cannot reduce affected units below {+2 Luck}.

spell.core.fortune.description.none:
{Fortune}

Increases {Luck} of {target allied unit} by {+1}.

{While Fortune lasts}, {Luck penalties} cannot reduce that unit below {+1 Luck}.

spell.core.misfortune.description.advanc:
{Advanced Misfortune}

Decreases {Luck} of {target enemy unit} by {-2}.

{While Misfortune lasts}, {Luck bonuses} cannot raise that unit above {-2 Luck}.

